    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61195" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωδύα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>head</i>, i.e. <i>capsule</i>,
			of the poppy, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.12.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Damocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.63
			</span></i> (v.l. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίαις</span>), <i><span class="en">
				64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
