			</span></i>, and so in <i><span class="en">
				Damocr.
			</span></i> l.c., but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώδυα</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				117
			</span></i> ap.Harp.Epit., <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, cf. sq.]</div>
